  "body": "Build your ideal home on this sought-after corner section with wide frontage, embracing open outlooks, abundant sunshine and a sense of space — an opportunity for premium coastal living in the Whangaparaoa Peninsula’s future key hub.\r\n\r\nLocation, location, location:\r\n• Nestled in the heart of Stanmore Bay, just steps from New World, local shops, and daily amenities.\r\n• Game-changing connectivity via Penlink (under construction): Right beside the future Penlink access, offering direct SH1 connectivity to the North Shore and CBD. Also next to the peninsula’s future transport hub, including the NX2 extension, for effortless connectivity.\r\n• Moments from Stanmore Bay Beach and Stanmore Bay Park, embracing an effortless coastal lifestyle.\r\n• Tucked away in a quiet, peaceful residential setting, giving you coastal tranquillity without compromising on central connectivity.\r\n• Perfectly positioned within easy reach of well-regarded schools, including Stanmore Bay School and Whangaparaoa College.\r\n\r\nSection Highlights:\r\n• Pristine, master-planned enclave featuring elevated positions, lush green surroundings, and wide-open views.\r\n• 451sqm (more or less) corner section, gently contoured with a generous frontage — the perfect canvas for premium coastal living, with all-day sunshine and open outlooks.\r\n• Fully serviced, titled sections with completed vehicle crossing ready for development.\r\n• Flexible Financing: Builder’s Terms available for up to 12 months, with up to 80% financing for section purchase through our business partner, plus construction loan financing of up to 80%, subject to lending criteria.\r\n\r\nOther Sections For Sale:\r\n• 9 Whenuateitei Crescent (Lot 12): 451sqm more or less\r\n• 35 Whenuateitei Crescent (Lot 25): 479 sqm more or less\r\n• 4 Pamu Wera Drive (Lot 45): 535 sqm more or less\r\n• 14 Pamu Wera Drive  (Lot 37): 445 sqm more or less\r\n• 2  Hau Tapu Loop (Lot 47): 550 sqm more or less\r\n• 3  Hau Tapu Loop (Lot 40): 443 sqm more or less\r\n• 5  Hau Tapu Loop (Lot 41): 450 sqm more or less\r\n• 10  Hau Tapu Loop (Lot 51): 600 sqm more or less\r\n• 18  Hau Tapu Loop (Lot 55): 629 sqm more or less\r\n\r\nTime to act fast. Secure your place in one of the peninsula’s most exciting new communities, with quality homes already taking shape. Be among the first to join the peninsula’s next growth hotspot. Call now!",
